@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557

title RB-D01 — Resource-scoped operation eligibility
start
if (RB-D01-C01\nScoped authority valid = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D01-C02\nCurrent state permits = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D01-C03\nOperation conditions met = T?) then (yes)
:RB-D01-R07\nELIGIBLE ONLY;
stop
else (no)
if (RB-D01-C03 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D01-R05\nREJECT CONDITIONS;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D01-R06\nUNRESOLVED CONDITIONS;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D01-C02 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D01-R03\nDENY CURRENT STATE;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D01-R04\nUNRESOLVED STATE;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D01-C01 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D01-R01\nDENY SCOPE;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D01-R02\nUNRESOLVED SCOPE;
stop
endif
endif
legend bottom
Decision alternatives, not execution steps or evaluation timing.
T = established true; F = established false; U = unresolved.
Conditions and full results are defined in the rule table.
All rows here are proposed analysis refinements; no new policy acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
